<title>USA: IPO FILING - Kaynar Technologies Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Kaynar Technologies Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Kaynar Technologies Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			KTIC.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 1.8 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  200,000</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,600,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter	     Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Fullerton, Calif.,-based Kaynar is a manufacturer of specialty fastners, fastening systems and related components primarily used by original equipment manufacturers and their subcontractors in the production of commercial aircraft and defense products.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay certain indebtedness and for working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Net Sales	     $99,023	    $68,781</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $5,295	     $2,311</p>
